{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You awaken in a space eroded by the abyss. Protect the light and press forward. Defeat the monsters within the abyss! Residents who escaped the abyss through the light will help you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three Legions: Erosion of the Abyss </strong>is a turn-based strategy RPG centered around roguelike elements, modified chess, and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine diverse residents from three races, their synergy effects, and your powers to defeat the monsters in the abyss! Have various encounters in the abyss, recover uncorrupted residents or relics from temples, or reclaim the light that hasn't vanished. Sometimes, taking a break is also a good method.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content provided in the Demo Version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 character with unique powers, relics, and weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The first playable area</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>72 diverse residents from 3 races</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 synergy combinations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 40 diverse relics divided into several grades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character's various powers, power acquisition system through experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 10 diverse enemies</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744090?t=1748415701","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744090?t=1748415701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744090/38